olive-css (0.8.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * MIT licence: LICENSE replaces COPYING, every source header is a short
    SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT block, and the generated CSS says MIT too.
  * olive-css command: generate the shipped builds, prune a site's CSS and
    list the builds; the generation scripts are gone.
  * The README is a landing page again and the guide lives in docs/.
  * maak release commits, tags, pushes and publishes the GitHub release.
  * The package installs /usr/bin/olive-css and the guide.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

